## Filter Criteria

The filter parameter must be URL encoded when sent. Filters are specified as JSON objects where each field can have
one or more filter operations.

### Filterable Fields

#### Core Workflow Fields
- **id**: Workflow unique identifier (String)
- **tenantId**: Tenant identifier (String)
- **tenantPractitionerId**: Tenant practitioner identifier (String)
- **createdAt**: Workflow creation timestamp (Timestamp)
- **updatedAt**: Workflow last update timestamp (Timestamp)

#### Data Fields - Workflow Information
- **data.externalId**: External identifier (String)
- **data.practitionerFileType**: Type of practitioner file (String)
- **data.credentialingCycle**: Credentialing cycle (String)
- **data.credentialedStates**: Array of credentialed states (Array - eq/in only)
- **data.assignedTo**: User assigned to the workflow (String)
- **data.assignedBy**: User who assigned the workflow (String)

#### Data Fields - Status & Dates
- **data.credentialingStatus**: Current workflow status (String)
- **data.psvReadyDate**: PSV ready date (Timestamp)
- **data.psvCompletedDate**: PSV completed date (Timestamp)
- **data.credentialingStatusLastUpdatedDate**: Status last updated date (Timestamp)
- **data.previousCredentialedDate**: Previous credentialing date (Date)
- **data.credentialingDueDate**: Credentialing due date (Date)
- **data.nextCredentialingDate**: Next credentialing date (Date)
- **data.credentialingDecisionDate**: Credentialing decision date (Date)

#### Data Fields - Practitioner Information
- **data.practitioner.firstName**: Practitioner first name (String, case-insensitive contains)
- **data.practitioner.middleName**: Practitioner middle name (String)
- **data.practitioner.lastName**: Practitioner last name (String, case-insensitive contains)
- **data.practitioner.npi**: National Provider Identifier (String)
- **data.practitioner.caqhProviderId**: CAQH Provider ID (String)
- **data.practitioner.primaryEmail**: Primary email address (String)
- **data.practitioner.licensedStates**: Array of licensed states (Array - eq/in only)
- **data.practitioner.practitionerTypesToCredential**: Array of practitioner types to credential (Array - eq/in only)
- **data.practitioner.statesToCredential**: Array of states to credential (Array - eq/in only)
- **data.practitioner.lineOfBusiness**: Array of lines of business (Array - eq/in only)
- **data.practitioner.userDefinedFields.market**: Array of markets (Array - eq/in only)

### Supported Filter Operations

#### String Fields (eq, neq, in, nin, contains)
- **eq**: Exact match - `{"field":{"eq":"value"}}`
- **neq**: Not equal - `{"field":{"neq":"value"}}`
- **in**: Match any value in array - `{"field":{"in":["value1","value2"]}}`
- **nin**: Not match any value in array - `{"field":{"nin":["value1","value2"]}}`
- **contains**: Substring match - `{"field":{"contains":"partial"}}` (case-insensitive for name fields)

#### Timestamp/Date Fields (eq, neq, gt, gte, lt, lte)
- **eq**: Exact match - `{"field":{"eq":"2023-01-01T00:00:00Z"}}`
- **neq**: Not equal - `{"field":{"neq":"2023-01-01T00:00:00Z"}}`
- **gt**: Greater than - `{"field":{"gt":"2023-01-01T00:00:00Z"}}`
- **gte**: Greater than or equal - `{"field":{"gte":"2023-01-01T00:00:00Z"}}`
- **lt**: Less than - `{"field":{"lt":"2023-01-01T00:00:00Z"}}`
- **lte**: Less than or equal - `{"field":{"lte":"2023-01-01T00:00:00Z"}}`

#### Array Fields (eq, in only)
- **eq**: Array contains value - `{"field":{"eq":"value"}}`
- **in**: Array contains any of these values - `{"field":{"in":["value1","value2"]}}`

### Filter Examples

#### Basic Filters (before URL encoding)
```json
// Filter by id
{"id":{"eq":"123"}}

// Filter by tenant
{"tenantId":{"eq":"tenant123"}}

// Filter by practitioner ID
{"tenantPractitionerId":{"eq":"practitioner456"}}

// Filter by credentialing status
{"data.credentialingStatus":{"eq":"PSV_READY"}}

// Filter by assigned user
{"data.assignedTo":{"eq":"user123"}}
```

#### Practitioner Filters
```json
// Search by practitioner first name (case-insensitive)
{"data.practitioner.firstName":{"contains":"Alice"}}

// Filter by NPI (exact match)
{"data.practitioner.npi":{"eq":"1234567890"}}

// Filter by CAQH Provider ID
{"data.practitioner.caqhProviderId":{"eq":"12345678"}}

// Filter by email
{"data.practitioner.primaryEmail":{"contains":"@example.com"}}
```

#### Array Field Filters
```json
// Filter by practitioner type to credential
{"data.practitioner.practitionerTypesToCredential":{"eq":"MD"}}

// Filter by multiple states to credential
{"data.practitioner.statesToCredential":{"in":["CA","NY","TX"]}}

// Filter by licensed states
{"data.practitioner.licensedStates":{"in":["CA","NY"]}}

// Filter by line of business
{"data.practitioner.lineOfBusiness":{"eq":"MEDICARE"}}

// Filter by multiple lines of business
{"data.practitioner.lineOfBusiness":{"in":["MEDICARE","MEDICAID"]}}

// Filter by market
{"data.practitioner.userDefinedFields.market":{"eq":"MARKET1"}}

// Filter by multiple markets
{"data.practitioner.userDefinedFields.market":{"in":["MARKET1","MARKET2"]}}

// Filter by credentialed states
{"data.credentialedStates":{"eq":"CA"}}
```

#### Date/Timestamp Filters
```json
// Workflows created after a date
{"createdAt":{"gt":"2023-01-01T00:00:00Z"}}

// PSV ready within a date range
{"data.psvReadyDate":{"gte":"2023-01-01T00:00:00Z","lte":"2023-12-31T23:59:59Z"}}

// Workflows updated in last 7 days
{"updatedAt":{"gte":"2023-01-15T00:00:00Z"}}
```

#### Combined Filters
```json
// Multiple conditions (AND logic)
{
  "data.practitioner.firstName":{"contains":"Alice"},
  "data.practitioner.npi":{"eq":"1234567890"},
  "data.credentialingStatus":{"eq":"PSV_READY"}
}

// Filter by status and date range
{
  "data.credentialingStatus":{"eq":"CRED_APPROVED"},
  "data.credentialingDecisionDate":{"gte":"2023-01-01","lte":"2023-12-31"}
}

// Filter by line of business and status
{
  "data.practitioner.lineOfBusiness":{"in":["MEDICARE"]},
  "data.credentialingStatus":{"eq":"PSV_READY"}
}

// Filter by market and status
{
  "data.practitioner.userDefinedFields.market":{"in":["MARKET1"]},
  "data.credentialingStatus":{"eq":"PSV_READY"}
}
```

### cURL Examples
```bash
# Filter by id
curl -X GET 'http://localhost:8080/credentialing-workflows?filter=%7B%22id%22%3A%7B%22eq%22%3A%22123%22%7D%7D'

# Filter by practitioner firstName (case-insensitive)
curl -X GET 'http://localhost:8080/credentialing-workflows?filter=%7B%22data.practitioner.firstName%22%3A%7B%22contains%22%3A%22Alice%22%7D%7D'

# Filter by NPI
curl -X GET 'http://localhost:8080/credentialing-workflows?filter=%7B%22data.practitioner.npi%22%3A%7B%22eq%22%3A%221234567890%22%7D%7D'

# Filter by states to credential
curl -X GET 'http://localhost:8080/credentialing-workflows?filter=%7B%22data.practitioner.statesToCredential%22%3A%7B%22in%22%3A%5B%22CA%22%2C%22NY%22%5D%7D%7D'

# Filter by line of business
curl -X GET 'http://localhost:8080/credentialing-workflows?filter=%7B%22data.practitioner.lineOfBusiness%22%3A%7B%22in%22%3A%5B%22MEDICARE%22%5D%7D%7D'

# Filter by market
curl -X GET 'http://localhost:8080/credentialing-workflows?filter=%7B%22data.practitioner.userDefinedFields.market%22%3A%7B%22in%22%3A%5B%22MARKET1%22%5D%7D%7D'

# Combined filter
curl -X GET 'http://localhost:8080/credentialing-workflows?filter=%7B%22data.practitioner.firstName%22%3A%7B%22contains%22%3A%22Alice%22%7D%2C%22data.credentialingStatus%22%3A%7B%22eq%22%3A%22PSV_READY%22%7D%7D'
```

**Note**: Always URL encode the JSON filter string before sending the request.

## Filter Criteria

The filter parameter must be URL encoded when sent. Filters are specified as JSON objects where each field can have
one or more filter operations.

### Filterable Fields

#### Core Timeline Event Fields
- **id**: Timeline event unique identifier (String)
- **createdBy**: User who created the timeline event (String)
- **createdAt**: Timeline event creation timestamp (Timestamp)
- **updatedAt**: Timeline event last update timestamp (Timestamp)

### Supported Filter Operations

#### String Fields (eq, neq, in, nin, contains)
- **eq**: Exact match - `{"field":{"eq":"value"}}`
- **neq**: Not equal - `{"field":{"neq":"value"}}`
- **in**: Match any value in array - `{"field":{"in":["value1","value2"]}}`
- **nin**: Not match any value in array - `{"field":{"nin":["value1","value2"]}}`
- **contains**: Substring match - `{"field":{"contains":"partial"}}` (case-sensitive)

#### Timestamp Fields (eq, neq, gt, gte, lt, lte)
- **eq**: Exact match - `{"field":{"eq":"2023-01-01T00:00:00Z"}}`
- **neq**: Not equal - `{"field":{"neq":"2023-01-01T00:00:00Z"}}`
- **gt**: Greater than - `{"field":{"gt":"2023-01-01T00:00:00Z"}}`
- **gte**: Greater than or equal - `{"field":{"gte":"2023-01-01T00:00:00Z"}}`
- **lt**: Less than - `{"field":{"lt":"2023-01-01T00:00:00Z"}}`
- **lte**: Less than or equal - `{"field":{"lte":"2023-01-01T00:00:00Z"}}`

### Filter Examples

#### Basic Filters (before URL encoding)
```json
// Filter by id
{"id":{"eq":"123"}}

// Filter by creator
{"createdBy":{"eq":"user@example.com"}}
```

#### Timestamp Filters
```json
// Timeline events created after a specific date
{"createdAt":{"gt":"2023-01-01T00:00:00Z"}}

// Timeline events created within a date range
{"createdAt":{"gte":"2023-01-01T00:00:00Z","lte":"2023-12-31T23:59:59Z"}}

// Timeline events updated in last 7 days
{"updatedAt":{"gte":"2023-01-15T00:00:00Z"}}
```

#### Advanced Filters
```json
// Exclude specific creators
{"createdBy":{"nin":["user1@example.com","user2@example.com"]}}

// Search by creator email contains
{"createdBy":{"contains":"@example.com"}}
```

#### Combined Filters
```json
// Filter by creator and date
{
  "createdBy":{"eq":"user@example.com"},
  "createdAt":{"gte":"2023-01-01T00:00:00Z"}
}

// Filter by creator and date range
{
  "createdBy":{"contains":"@example.com"},
  "createdAt":{"gte":"2023-01-01T00:00:00Z","lte":"2023-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
}
```

### cURL Examples
```bash
# Filter by id
curl -X GET 'http://localhost:8080/credentialing-workflows/{workflowId}/timeline-events?filter=%7B%22id%22%3A%7B%22eq%22%3A%22123%22%7D%7D'

# Filter by creator
curl -X GET 'http://localhost:8080/credentialing-workflows/{workflowId}/timeline-events?filter=%7B%22createdBy%22%3A%7B%22eq%22%3A%22user%40example.com%22%7D%7D'

# Filter by creation date range
curl -X GET 'http://localhost:8080/credentialing-workflows/{workflowId}/timeline-events?filter=%7B%22createdAt%22%3A%7B%22gte%22%3A%222023-01-01T00%3A00%3A00Z%22%2C%22lte%22%3A%222023-12-31T23%3A59%3A59Z%22%7D%7D'

# Combined filter: creator and date
curl -X GET 'http://localhost:8080/credentialing-workflows/{workflowId}/timeline-events?filter=%7B%22createdBy%22%3A%7B%22contains%22%3A%22%40example.com%22%7D%2C%22createdAt%22%3A%7B%22gte%22%3A%222023-01-01T00%3A00%3A00Z%22%7D%7D'
```

**Note**: Always URL encode the JSON filter string before sending the request.
